Package: palang
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: lightweight native IDE for Linux
 Palang is a fast, lightweight code editor built with GTK 4, libadwaita
 and GtkSourceView: tabs, a folder tree, find and replace, syntax
 highlighting for many languages, and light and dark styles.
